{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10006_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:645450afab3af7403bd72eb47fafd0dbb5f825e4a3c38a56e92b2c76ee568d48",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_b:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f25c3bf2a61b68827c07cb4ddb024c9e19d8fb3ec4522cfa656962631675a85",
      "text": "没想到真的能请到もふもふえん来参加结业典礼……！\n非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cd389a3dcae3736cfea0024eb7cff62e9706702649c7cc317fb6bf9f97d5ddc",
      "text": "我们才要感谢您委托这份工作！\n各位发来的邮件，我和もふもふえん一起看过了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5bff2fa589b9b988ea06a38f1c05929e630fcca7cdec9f154e37d75a86de947",
      "text": "请、请问，“小朋友们票选的、\n最希望在结业典礼上见到的人排行榜！”我们也看到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1251db3b61522a8618ec5eefddaa83f74233698f0202e913545af400ac5085de",
      "text": "仅次于爸爸妈妈，\n花音他们もふもふえん排在后面呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2892aac4b6c5efe668f1cca7f93ca586f120f00ffc89d47879eb0f14ee7027c",
      "text": "超级开心的啊。\n结业典礼，我们绝对会让它成功的，请多关照啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa9e2e4b19e88ee6cd48d39a8b2900e179013b66193a7f73cd327f9c373c3f38",
      "text": "不、不行啦志狼君。\n声音太大声的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_b:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06d9eab79753633557123f6abfe235c36141d1c77f3d82d69a395e7ef40202ce",
      "text": "不、不好意思。我们要出场的事情要保密来着对吧。\n那个……请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_b:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19b3cf6288e864cb5e0a2cc548f2361c451e8b1bd18babec5bf83be99731d27b",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿……花音他们的舞台，\n能吓他们一大跳就好了呀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_b:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1aee2aabde45258610efbacd447ee1f375453ab1d07056e6040d838b7ea8e6a",
      "text": "是啊。到结业典礼当天为止，\n我们3个人要一起加油练习哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_b:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:290ca9554244e02527bc330614f7e26d35e637e3ef059718e80fa8775ab6100a",
      "text": "噢——",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
